reconfigure.description:
Current stop place: **{name}**

Routes: {routes}

Platform selection: {platforms}

Shown on map: {show_on_map}

Legend: — = all routes, ● = stop place only, ∞ = all active platforms, a number = selected platforms, ✓ = shown on the map.

Choose **Edit this stop place** to add or remove routes, platforms, and the map setting. Choose **Replace stop place** only when the monitored location itself should change. To remove the whole stop place, use its three-dot menu in the integration view.
